Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: main display row on Display, Personalization >
 Fonts

Display: "Make this my main display" for the selected monitor (saved for
Lapin's shell and notifications; default: laptop panel, else the top-left
monitor). Fonts: text smoothing for apps using the system's font settings
(GTK keys + Lapin's session font file) and Lapin's own text contrast.
Refs #31, Refs #40
